%% aoneahsan-cccs-custom-made — start from the product, take out the tells, test the real thing
flowchart TD
    trigger([Anything a person sees or reads,<br/>on any project, without being asked]) --> load[Load this skill and the surface's skills]
    load --> read[The project read:<br/>who and when · its words · its look]
    read --> kind{New product,<br/>or existing?}
    kind -->|new| world[Its own world at every level]
    kind -->|existing, team or client| belong[Its design language and voice are the material:<br/>belong, then raise it]
    world --> make[Make it from those,<br/>with real objects and believable data]
    belong --> make
    make --> tells[Take out the tells for each surface touched]
    tells --> tests{Swap · read aloud · looking ·<br/>why · stress}
    tests -->|a test fails| rewrite[Go back to the project read,<br/>not to a synonym]
    rewrite --> make
    tests -->|all pass| report([Report honestly:<br/>the tests, and anything still generated])
